{"answer":null,"concept_id":"explicit-smem-vs-l1-cache","content_sha256":"sha256:24665b0bd27068a1e268e3d26ad2f629e19c8d61d77689dee5d66618ae24be22","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789366773.754049,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"层次题第三层：可编程 vs 硬件缓存。","id":"q-operator-l1-vs-smem-explicit-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"复用模式是软件已知的二维滑窗，smem 可编程、可双缓冲、可与 TMA/MMA 对齐。L1 是硬件缓存，对不规则/跨步/一次用超容量的访问容易抖动。高性能核把热数据的放置权拿回来"},{"id":"b","text":"L1 比 smem 更大更快，应尽量不用 smem"},{"id":"c","text":"Hopper 以后没有 smem 了，全靠 L1"},{"id":"d","text":"显式 smem 只为了调试，发布版应删掉"}],"prompt":"为什么 GEMM/FA 要把 tile 显式放进 shared memory，而不是指望 L1 缓存自动命中？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"mechanism","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"CUTLASS overview","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cutlass/latest/overview.html"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"computer-architecture","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
